  "body_text": "人生路上有很多路口要面临选择\n每一次选择都好像开启了一个新的支线任务一样\n不管是什么，都要努力完成它\n感谢一路以来大家伙的相伴\n感谢商场所有的配合与疫情以来的支持\n感谢很多很多人\n...实在憋不出什么辞藻来了...此处省略至少2百5字\n两件事\n1- 梅龙镇店10月底关店\n2- 北京西路店9.27正式营业\n明天（9.22）开始，梅龙镇店开启买1赠1活动，不限品项，不论是咖啡还是挂耳包，算是回馈吧，也留一段回忆。\n后天（9.23）开始，北京西路店试营业，所有饮品8折，消费即可领取挂耳1包。\n有舍，才有得！\n新店求关注，踩点",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          人生路上有很多路口要面临选择\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          每一次选择都好像开启了一个新的支线任务一样\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不管是什么，都要努力完成它\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          感谢一路以来大家伙的相伴\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          感谢商场所有的配合与疫情以来的支持\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          感谢很多很多人\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ...实在憋不出什么辞藻来了...此处省略至少2百5字\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          两件事\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1- 梅龙镇店10月底关店\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2- 北京西路店9.27正式营业\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          明天（9.22）开始，梅龙镇店开启买1赠1活动，不限品项，不论是咖啡还是挂耳包，算是回馈吧，也留一段回忆。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          后天（9.23）开始，北京西路店试营业，所有饮品8折，消费即可领取挂耳1包。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有舍，才有得！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          新店求关注，踩点\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TuWj6obFXvOcIAkmLKBictjCZqvUuA6eic0UPxl09APLrH28sdHWDG9IMmOF73DE3fqIAExFibsJFSw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
